#: ../../language/error_codes/E0094.md:1
msgid "E0094"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0094.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `unknown_intrinsic`"
msgstr "警告名：`unknown_intrinsic`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0094.md:5
msgid ""
"The [`#intrinsic`](/language/attributes/intrinsic.md) attribute names an "
"intrinsic that the compiler does not recognize. The compiler ignores the "
"attribute and uses the ordinary function body instead. This warning is "
"enabled by default."
msgstr "[`#intrinsic`](/language/attributes/intrinsic.md) 属性に、コンパイラが認識できない組み込み命令名が指定されています。コンパイラは属性を無視し、代わりに通常の関数本体を使用します。この警告はデフォルトで有効です。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0094.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "誤った例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0094.md:11
msgid ""
"The name below is deliberately fictitious. The function still returns "
"`42` for the input `41`, but its attribute produces a warning:"
msgstr "以下の名前は意図的に架空のものにしています。入力 `41` に対して関数は引き続き `42` を返しますが、属性によって警告が発生します："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0094.md:14
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"#intrinsic(\"%not_a_real_intrinsic\")\n"
"pub fn add_one(value : Int32) -> Int32 {\n"
"  value + 1\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"test {\n"
"  assert_eq(add_one(41), 42)\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0094.md:18
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修正案"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0094.md:20
msgid ""
"Remove the attribute and keep the ordinary implementation. Intrinsics are"
" not a stable API and are not recommended for application code."
msgstr "属性を削除し、通常の実装を残してください。組み込み命令は安定した API ではなく、アプリケーションコードでの使用は推奨されません。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0094.md:23
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn add_one(value : Int32) -> Int32 {\n"
"  value + 1\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"test {\n"
"  assert_eq(add_one(41), 42)\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0094.md:27
msgid ""
"This differs from [E4070](E4070.md): a declaration such as `fn f(x : "
"Int32) -> Int32 = \"%not_a_real_intrinsic\"` has no ordinary function "
"body to fall back to, so an unknown intrinsic is an error rather than a "
"warning."
msgstr "[E4070](E4070.md) とは異なります。`fn f(x : Int32) -> Int32 = \"%not_a_real_intrinsic\"` のような宣言には代わりに使える通常の関数本体がないため、未知の組み込み命令は警告ではなくエラーになります。"
